  "body": "## Repair\n\nFixes the two validator defects exposed by the Onirim golden-path live fire:\n\n- lawful approval-only intermediate heads may have zero post-approval manifest changes;\n- declared protected merge validation unwraps the exact-base two-parent merge and validates semantic history through its second parent, matching synthetic PR validation.\n\n## Reproduction and verification\n\n- Reproduced approval-only false failure at `bdd0fb408c1f5c847f399007653a72253166d799`.\n- Reproduced failed protected-main run: https://github.com/no-trbl-2-u/game-knowledge-base/actions/runs/30695788397\n- Added disposable-clone regression over the permanent golden-path history.\n- Exact former failing command now clean against merge `773e2cee26dba96a2a669adf68555af5db243c7e`.\n- 44 active tests passed; 1 intentional skip; 0 failed.\n- 2,637 OKFs clean; index fresh.\n- Visual suite 5/5.\n\nNo corpus semantic content changed.",
